OL,3,GNEWSACalls for tougher e-bike and
OL,4,Ascooter enforcement
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has called for stricter
OL,7,Fenforcement against illegal e-scooters
OL,8,Fand modified e-bikes.
OL,10,FA motion discussed by Nottinghamshire
OL,11,Fcounty councillors on Thursday said the
OL,12,Fvehicles pose a "growing safety and
OL,13,Fanti-social behaviour risk" to
OL,14,Fpedestrians, cyclists, and motorists.
OL,16,FIt called for a change in the law to
OL,17,Fmake it an offence to operate a
OL,18,Fmotor-powered vehicle unless it is
OL,19,Fregistered, taxed and insured and the
OL,20,Foperator holds a licence, regardless of
OL,21,Fits power or the speed it can achieve.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
